1795236192392	{"id":{"$t":"tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-8657703664257880060.post-2828141032795498129"},"published":{"$t":"2026-11-20T23:43:12.392-05:00"},"updated":{"$t":"2026-11-20T23:43:12.392-05:00"},"category":[{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"Articles"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"History"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"lang-ne"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"Nepali"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"pair-smallpox1"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"pinned"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"Published Articles"}],"title":{"type":"text","$t":"बिफरको नेपाली इतिहास (भाग १): रणबहादुर, कान्तिवती, गिर्वाणयुद्ध र शीतला माजुको कथा"},"summary":{"type":"text","$t":"यो लेख पहिलो पटक २०८३ असोज १४ गते शिलापत्रमा “बासभ : समयको उत्खनन” स्तम्भमा प्रकाशित भएको थियो। शिलापत्रमा प्रकाशित लेखको हेडर । “स्वामि जुजुया धर्म मदया कचिमचा वाके छोत, वनेमाल तामाखुसि पारिनेपालया छत्रपति श्री रणबहादुर, परजान अति दु:ख सिलमते मते सितला माजु सहश्र बिनति छिके, याहुने लोक उधार।” “स्वामी राजामा धर्म नभएर बच्चाहरू निकालिए, तामाकोसीपारि जानुपर्‍यो।नेपालका छत्रपति श्री रणबहादुर, प्रजाले"},"link":[{"rel":"replies","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"https://www.kafka.blog/feeds/2828141032795498129/comments/default","title":"Post Comments"},{"rel":"replies","type":"text/html","href":"https://www.kafka.blog/2026/11/bifar-nepali-itihas-bhag-1-shitala-maju.html#comment-form","title":"0 Comments"},{"rel":"edit","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"https://www.blogger.com/feeds/8657703664257880060/posts/default/2828141032795498129"},{"rel":"self","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"https://www.blogger.com/feeds/8657703664257880060/posts/default/2828141032795498129"},{"rel":"alternate","type":"text/html","href":"https://www.kafka.blog/2026/11/bifar-nepali-itihas-bhag-1-shitala-maju.html","title":"बिफरको नेपाली इतिहास (भाग १): रणबहादुर, कान्तिवती, गिर्वाणयुद्ध र शीतला माजुको कथा"}],"author":[{"name":{"$t":"Unknown"},"email":{"$t":"noreply@blogger.com"},"gd$image":{"rel":"http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail","width":"16","height":"16","src":"https://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif"}}],"media$thumbnail":{"xmlns$media":"http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/","url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/d/1i2U3o1EjZ-QqTziqhG6n-5BecvjFXXBb=s72-w1200-c","height":"72","width":"72"},"thr$total":{"$t":"0"}}